      "message": "test(sim): pin the hidden-stock arm of the rapid law with a ball rim over a ledge\n\nSince #140's march, deleting the hidden_along call in verify/rapids.rs\nleft every overhang_laws test green. A ball r6 lateral rapid at Z 9.5\nwhose rim alone reaches over the ledge band: the march judges the rim\nat the ball's lift over columns cut to the ledge top and acquits it,\nwhile the hidden-stock arm reads the disc at the tip plane through the\nuncut band under the ledge and convicts. The same moves beside a bare\npost are clean, so the conviction is that arm's alone; with the call\ndeleted the new test fails and nothing else does.\n\nFixes #206\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
